**profile.cpp maps calibration sources and constructs built-in controller profiles.**

## API

`to_string(value_source s) noexcept -> const char*` returns `"built-in"`, `"measured"`, or `"user"`; unknown values fall back to `"built-in"`.

`default_profile(controller::family f) noexcept -> profile` creates `profile::current_version` built-in identity calibration, zeroed sticks/triggers/motion, and `smoothing = 0.0f`.

## Coupling

`profile`, `value_source`, `stick_calibration`, and `trigger_calibration` come from `profile.hpp`.